{"availability":"available","full":"seoes/proval","name":"proval","description":"Self-Hosted LLM Code Review Agent for GitLab, Forgejo and GitHub. Local LLM support","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":116,"forks":5,"created":"2026-07-05T05:29:51Z","updated":"2026-10-14T23:34:13Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://proval.app","topics":["agent","code-review","code-review-agent","code-review-assistant","code-review-tool","code-reviewer","coderabbit","coderabbit-alternative","llm","open-source","self-hosted","version-control"],"demo":"https://demo.proval.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:15:39.538Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T05:15:39.538Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T05:15:39.538Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:18:14.675Z","stars":104,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:31:16.606Z","stars":106,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:09:02.362Z","stars":109,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-11T07:24:17.988Z","stars":111,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-17T05:15:39.538Z","stars":116,"forks":5}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Self-hosted LLM code review agent. Connect it to your Git host, bring your own model, and let it review pull requests and issues on your own infrastructure.","Proval takes 3 min, less than 10 lines to deploy to your server","Proval works with OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions APIs, so you can use OpenAI, local model APIs like Ollama and llama.cpp, or any internal LLM gateway. Anthropic and Gemini support are planned as first-class integrations."],"features":["Bring your own LLM (Even local models)","GitLab, Forgejo, and GitHub support","When a pull request gets a meaningful push (or a draft becomes ready), Proval reads the diff, groups changed files into review units, runs specialist sub-agents to investigate each group, and writes a consolidated…","Works on issues too. Proval leaves a comment when one opens, and can reply when someone comments back. You can set it to respond to every message or only when @mentioned.","Findings are posted directly on the affected lines of code. Proval handles single-line and multi-line positions for GitHub, GitLab, and Forgejo."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/seoes/proval/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"be37c1e04a4fadc6889a72ad52f59a27fda102b9439365a00b243ba57d75b541","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:12:44.823Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:12.751Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Self-hosted LLM code review agent. Connect it to your Git host, bring your own model, and let it review pull requests and issues on your own infrastructure.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/seoes/proval/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"I was looking for a self hosted code review using my own LLM but couldn't find one I liked.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/seoes/proval/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"be37c1e04a4fadc6889a72ad52f59a27fda102b9439365a00b243ba57d75b541","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/seoes/proval/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:12.751Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T01:31:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/seoes/proval/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:12.751Z","hash":"be37c1e04a4fadc6889a72ad52f59a27fda102b9439365a00b243ba57d75b541","originalBytes":7198,"storedBytes":7198,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:12:44.825Z","qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T12:28:06.877Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T12:28:06.877Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/6547c9a4ba925e838968ca76.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-17T05:35:34.518Z","url":"https://demo.proval.app/"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://demo.proval.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T05:35:34.518Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T05:35:34.518Z","lastWorkingAt":"20